    <https://w3id.org/CMEO/aachen-hf/secondary_outcome_specification> a cmeo:secondary_outcome_specification ;
        rdfs:label "secondary outcome specification"^^xsd:string ;
        cmeo:has_value """• hospitalization (first and recurring) due to heart failure 
• hospitalization (first and recurring) due to any cause 
• hospitalization due to fatal and non-fatal pulmonary embolism 
• hospitalization due to severe bacterial or viral infection
• time until sepsis occurs
• length of time to non-cardiac death
• time to total mortality
• time to non-fatal heart attack
• time to non-fatal acute coronary syndrome
• time to survived sudden cardiac death
• time to non-fatal end stage renal failure
• how long it takes to develop non-steroidal diabetes in patients with prediabetes
• time taken to develop nonsteroidal diabetes in patients with normoglycemia
• time taken to develop non-steroidal prediabetes in patients with normoglycemia
• time taken to develop hfref in patients with hfmref
• time taken to develop hfref in patients with hfpef
• time taken to develop hfmref in patients with hfpef"""^^xsd:string .

