    <https://w3id.org/CMEO/believe/objective_specification> a obi:objective_specification ;
        cmeo:has_value "the study is designed  to quantify the burden and trends of non-communicable diseases (ncds), including cardiovascular, metabolic, respiratory, and neoplastic diseases, and related risk factors across different geographical settings in bangladesh and identify their demographic, societal, economic, and hereditary drivers."^^xsd:string .

