        rdfs:label "primary outcome specification"^^xsd:string ;
        cmeo:has_value "since the study includes a broad range of demographic, behavioral, socio-economic, physical and biological factors, multiple diseases and analyses (genomics, proteomics, metabolomics), there can be multiple secondary outcomes. some examples: to inform public health action in a representative low-middle income country (bangladesh); to investigate maternal and child health"^^xsd:string .

