    <https://w3id.org/CMEO/dyda/objective_specification> a obi:objective_specification ;
        cmeo:has_value "baseline clinical, ecg, laboratory and echocardiographic data from 751 patients (61 ± 7 years, 59% hypertensive) recruited by 37 italian diabetes clinics were analysed. clinical history, life habits, laboratory data (nt-probnp, hscrp, hba1c, serum glucose, lipids and creatinine, liver enzymes, microalbuminuria, glomerular filtrate) and data on microvascular complications and drug therapy were collected."^^xsd:string .

