    <https://w3id.org/CMEO/reflecs/timeline_specification> a cmeo:timeline_specification ;
        cmeo:has_value "2 planned visits for each study patient: baseline and follow-up. The data is also collected during the discharge of the patient. If the patient visits hospital in between the scheduled visits for cardiac reasons, the echocardiography and gyrocardiography measurements are aimed to be repeated during this visit if applicable."^^xsd:string .

